#: warehouse/templates/email/account-deleted/body.html:5
#, python-format
msgid "Your PyPI account <strong>%(username)s</strong> has been deleted."
msgstr "Ditt PyPI-konto <strong>%(username)s</strong> har tagits bort."

#: warehouse/templates/email/added-as-collaborator/body.html:9
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You have been added as <strong><a "
"href=\"%(role_faq_url)s\">%(role)s</a></strong> to the %(site)s project <a "
"href=\"%(project_url)s\">%(project_name)s</a> by <a "
"href=\"%(initiator_url)s\">%(initiator_username)s</a>."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"%(initiator_url)s\">%(initiator_username)s</a> har lagt till dig "
"som <strong><a href=\"%(role_faq_url)s\">%(role)s</a></strong> i "
"%(site)s-projektet <a href=\"%(project_url)s\">%(project_name)s</a>."

#: warehouse/templates/email/added-as-collaborator/body.html:15
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You are receiving this because you have been added by <a "
"href=\"%(initiator_url)s\">%(initiator_username)s</a> to a project on "
"%(site)s."
msgstr ""
"Du får detta eftersom <a "
"href=\"%(initiator_url)s\">%(initiator_username)s</a> har lagt till dig i "
"ett projekt på %(site)s."

#: warehouse/templates/email/added-as-organization-member/body.html:6
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You have been added as <strong>%(role)s</strong> of the %(site)s "
"organization %(organization_name)s by <a "
"href=\"%(submitter_profile)s\">%(submitter)s</a>."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"%(submitter_profile)s\">%(submitter)s</a> har lagt till dig som "
"<strong>%(role)s</strong> i %(site)s-organisationen %(organization_name)s."

#: warehouse/templates/email/added-as-organization-member/body.html:10
#: warehouse/templates/email/role-changed-as-organization-member/body.html:10
msgid "You are receiving this because you are a member of this organization."
msgstr "Du får detta eftersom du är medlem i organisationen."

#: warehouse/templates/email/added-as-team-collaborator/body.html:6
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Your team has been added with <strong>%(role)s</strong> permissions to the "
"%(site)s project %(project)s by %(submitter)s."
msgstr ""
"%(submitter)s har lagt till ditt team med behörigheten "
"<strong>%(role)s</strong> i %(site)s-projektet %(project)s."

#: warehouse/templates/email/added-as-team-collaborator/body.html:10
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You are receiving this because your team has been added by %(submitter)s to "
"a project on %(site)s."
msgstr ""
"Du får detta eftersom %(submitter)s har lagt till ditt team i ett projekt på"
" %(site)s."

#: warehouse/templates/email/added-as-team-member/body.html:5
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You have been added as a member of the \"%(team_name)s\" team in the "
"\"%(organization_name)s\" organization by <a "
"href=\"%(submitter_profile)s\">%(submitter)s</a>."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"%(submitter_profile)s\">%(submitter)s</a> har lagt till dig som "
"medlem i teamet ”%(team_name)s” i organisationen ”%(organization_name)s”."

#: warehouse/templates/email/added-as-team-member/body.html:9
msgid "You are receiving this because you are a member of this team."
msgstr "Du får detta eftersom du är medlem i teamet."

#: warehouse/templates/email/api-token-used-in-trusted-publisher-project/body.html:6
#, python-format
msgid ""
"An API token belonging to user <a "
"href=\"%(account_href)s\">%(token_owner_username)s</a> was used to upload "
"files to the project <a href=\"%(project_href)s\">%(project_name)s</a>, even"
" though the project has a Trusted Publisher configured. This may have been "
"in error. We recommend removing the API token and only using the Trusted "
"Publisher to publish."
msgstr ""
"En API-token som tillhör användaren <a "
"href=\"%(account_href)s\">%(token_owner_username)s</a> användes för att "
"ladda upp filer till projektet <a "
"href=\"%(project_href)s\">%(project_name)s</a>, trots att projektet har en "
"betrodd utgivare konfigurerad. Det kan ha skett av misstag. Vi rekommenderar"
" att API-token tas bort och att endast den betrodda utgivaren används för "
"publicering."

#: warehouse/templates/email/api-token-used-in-trusted-publisher-project/body.html:19
#, python-format
msgid ""
"If you are the owner of this token, you can delete it by going to your <a "
"href=\"%(href)s#api-tokens\">API tokens configuration</a> and deleting the "
"token named <strong>%(token_name)s</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Om du äger denna token kan du ta bort den under <a href=\"%(href)s#api-"
"tokens\">konfigurationen av API-token</a> genom att ta bort token med namnet"
" <strong>%(token_name)s</strong>."

#: warehouse/templates/email/api-token-used-in-trusted-publisher-project/body.html:26
#, python-format
msgid ""
"If you believe this was done in error, you can email <a "
"href=\"%(href)s\">%(email_address)s</a> to communicate with the PyPI "
"administrators."
msgstr ""
"Om du tror att detta har skett av misstag kan du skicka e-post till <a "
"href=\"%(href)s\">%(email_address)s</a> för att kontakta PyPI:s "
"administratörer."

#: warehouse/templates/email/canceled-as-invited-organization-member/body.html:5
#, python-format
msgid ""
"An invitation for you to join the \"%(organization_name)s\" organization has"
" been canceled"
msgstr ""
"En inbjudan till dig att ansluta till organisationen ”%(organization_name)s”"
" har avbrutits"

#: warehouse/templates/email/canceled-as-invited-organization-member/body.html:9
#: warehouse/templates/email/declined-as-invited-organization-member/body.html:9
#: warehouse/templates/email/verify-organization-role/body.html:14
msgid ""
"You are receiving this because you were invited to join this organization."
msgstr "Du får detta eftersom du bjöds in till organisationen."

#: warehouse/templates/email/declined-as-invited-organization-member/body.html:5
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You have declined an invitation to join the \"%(organization_name)s\" "
"organization"
msgstr ""
"Du har tackat nej till en inbjudan att ansluta till organisationen "
"”%(organization_name)s”."

#: warehouse/templates/email/new-email-added/body.html:5
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Hello, %(username)s. A new email '%(new_email_address)s' has been added to "
"your account."
msgstr ""
"Hej %(username)s! En ny e-postadress, ”%(new_email_address)s”, har lagts "
"till på ditt konto."

#: warehouse/templates/email/new-email-added/body.html:8
#, python-format
msgid ""
"If you did not make this change, you can email <a "
"href=\"%(href)s\">%(new_email_address)s</a> to communicate with the PyPI "
"administrators."
msgstr ""
"Om du inte gjorde den här ändringen kan du skicka e-post till <a "
"href=\"%(href)s\">%(new_email_address)s</a> för att kontakta PyPI:s "
"administratörer."

#: warehouse/templates/email/new-organization-approved/body.html:6
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Your new organization named '%(organization_name)s' has been approved and "
"created."
msgstr ""
"Din nya organisation ”%(organization_name)s” har godkänts och skapats."

#: warehouse/templates/email/new-organization-approved/body.html:8
msgid ""
"You are the owner of the new organization and can log in to manage "
"organization projects, collaborators, teams, or settings."
msgstr ""
"Du är ägare till den nya organisationen och kan logga in för att hantera "
"organisationens projekt, medarbetare, team och inställningar."

#: warehouse/templates/email/new-organization-approved/body.html:10
msgid "Manage organization"
msgstr "Hantera organisation"

#: warehouse/templates/email/new-organization-approved/body.html:14
msgid ""
"As this is a Company organization, you must purchase at least one (1) seat. "
"Company organizations without an active subscription are deactivated after "
"30 days. After deactivation, the organization name may be made available for"
" others to claim through a new organization application."
msgstr ""
"Eftersom detta är en företagsorganisation måste du köpa minst en plats. "
"Företagsorganisationer utan aktiv prenumeration inaktiveras efter 30 dagar. "
"Efter inaktiveringen kan organisationsnamnet göras tillgängligt så att andra"
" kan ansöka om det i en ny organisationsansökan."

#: warehouse/templates/email/new-organization-approved/body.html:17
msgid "Activate your subscription"
msgstr "Aktivera prenumerationen"

#: warehouse/templates/email/new-organization-approved/body.html:20
#: warehouse/templates/email/organization-subscription-required/body.html:20
msgid ""
"Company organizations are for for-profit companies. Community organizations "
"are for community-supported projects and teams. Non-profits, NGOs, schools, "
"and other non-commercial groups belong here too; you do not need to be an "
"informal project to qualify. Publishing open-source packages does not by "
"itself qualify a company for a Community organization."
msgstr ""
"Företagsorganisationer är för vinstdrivande företag. "
"Gemenskapsorganisationer är för projekt och team som stöds av en gemenskap. "
"Ideella organisationer, icke-statliga organisationer, skolor och andra icke-"
"kommersiella grupper hör också hemma här. Du behöver inte vara ett "
"informellt projekt för att kvalificera dig. Att publicera paket med öppen "
"källkod gör inte i sig ett företag kvalificerat för en "
"gemenskapsorganisation."

#: warehouse/templates/email/new-organization-approved/body.html:23
#: warehouse/templates/includes/manage/company-org-survey-callout.html:14
msgid "Interested in a PyPI service agreement?"
msgstr "Intresserad av ett tjänsteavtal för PyPI?"
